          </constraints>
        </entryLink>
      </entryLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Lineage and Honor" id="9227-55b5-ae13-85eb" hidden="false">
          <description>The Scion grants the mental fortitude special rule to itself and any unit it joins. All units within 6” also get +1WP. If the Scion is killed during the battle, all units in the High elf army get -2WP for the rest of the battle and all unengaged units within 6” of where the Scion died must take a bravery test. The loss of the Scion also grants the side that killed the scion 150 victory points.

The Scion must be your army&apos;s general and thus you can only have one.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
